Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I put one habit down.\NThought I was good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a different hunger came.\NSame ache, different clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Different label, same flame.\NDifferent road, same rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not broken, I am learning.\NThe pattern knows my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name.\NTrigger to craving, back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:01:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Short relief, heavy return.\NI can face what is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name.\NI can slow it. I can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,One clear pause, one breath.\NI choose a different step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress at midnight.\NLonely mornings pull hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Food, scrolling, spending.\NWork, nicotine, dodge the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:02:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind learned survival\Nfrom whatever eased pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I teach it gentler ways.\NNot perfect - just real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Map the hour and feeling.\NBuild a refuge that holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If risk rises, get medical help.\NThen heal the deeper pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hypnotherapy for the pause.\NEFT to calm the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:03:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Small repeats make a pathway.\NThe pathway starts to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name.\NI know the pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Trigger to craving\Ndoes not own me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Same brain, new patterns.\NDay by day, I find my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.85,0:03:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What was automatic can be relearned.\NSame loop, new ending.
